ont-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-light\">Why EarnedStar</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-navy sm:text-4xl\">Everything generic review tools get wrong</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center text-text-muted\">Open platforms let anyone post anything. EarnedStar only publishes what was earned.</p><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6\"><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">AI Fraud Detection</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Every submission runs behavioral scoring, device fingerprinting, and NLP analysis in under 200ms. Fake reviews never reach your product page.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gold/30 bg-navy px-4 py-2 shadow-sm scale-90 origin-left\" data-surface=\"dark\"><span class=\"relative inline-block shrink-0\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" overflow=\"visible\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><filter id=\"ds-_R_licf5ftb_\" x=\"-55%\" y=\"-45%\" width=\"210%\" height=\"210%\"><feGaussianBlur in=\"SourceAlpha\" stdDeviation=\"0.8663200000000001\" result=\"b1\"></feGaussianBlur><feOffset in=\"b1\" dx=\"0.18563999999999997\" dy=\"2.3514399999999998\" result=\"off1\"></feOffset><feFlood flood-