638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-white/70\">2,847<!-- --> order-verified reviews</p></div></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">The Origami EarnedStar Badge</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Four embed variants — Pill, Card, Stamp, and Dark — with your logo in the center medallion. Merchants display them with pride.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Verified by Purchase</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Every review ties to a confirmed order invitation. No guest reviews. No open submissions. No adding stars without verification.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Google Seller Ratings</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">JSON-LD schema auto-injects. Stars appear in Search and Shopping within 72 hours.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Multi-Channel Invitations</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Email, SMS, or QR code. Smart timing sends 7 days post-delivery.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">White-Label for Agencies</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Custom domain, your logo in the star center, 25 sub-accounts — one Agency plan.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Full Analytics</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Rating distribution, sentiment trends, invitation response rates, and conversion correlation.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"section-stone border-y border-border py-24\" data-scroll-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-light\">How reviews earn their star</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-navy\">No random reviews. No fake scores. Just buyers who actually ordered.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm text-text-muted\">Every review passes order verification, fraud screening, and your approval before it publishes — or it never touches your rating.</p><div class=\"relative mt-16 space-y-12\"><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Connect orders</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Link your store or import past reviews matched to orders — one-time migration, then invitations only.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Invite real buyers</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Fulfilled orders trigger branded invitations. No open form, no guest reviews, no bought ratings.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Every review earns its star</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Purchase check → fraud score → your approval → publish. Only then does it count toward your badge.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"bg-cream py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14\"><div class=\"mb-14 grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"smallcaps mb-3 text-[10px] text-gold-dark\">Receipts — vs. theirs</div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-balance\">Look at the <em class=\"text-gold-dark\">whole</em> table.<br/>Not the brochure.</h2></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8\"><p class=\"text-pretty text-sm leading-[1.65] text-ink/55\">Sourced from competitor docs, G2, and merchant complaint threads on Reddit (2026). Updated continuously. We&#x27;ll correct any line within 24 hours if you flag it — that&#x27;s a public promise, not a button.</p></div></div><div class=\"vellum-card gilded-edge overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[820px] border-collapse text-left\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b-2 border-ink\"><th class=\"smallcaps w-[34%] p-5 text-[10px] text-ink/45\">Feature</th><th class=\"bg-gold-light/20 p-5 font-heading text-2xl italic tracking-tight text-ink\">EarnedStar</th><th class=\"p-5 text-sm font-bold text-ink/65\">Trustpilot</th><th class=\"p-5 text-sm font-bold text-ink/65\">Yotpo</th><th class=\"p-5 text-sm font-bold text-ink/65\">Judge.me</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Verified-by-purchase only</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">partial</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Public Trust Receipt</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Public Moderation Ledger</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">24h dispute SLA, public counter</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">AI Smart-Reply on entry plan</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">enterprise</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">premium</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Native email + SMS</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">discontinued 2025</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Multi-domain on one plan</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">per-domain</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Portable reviews — yours forever</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Flat pricing, no annual lock-in</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-ink\"><span class=\"gold-foil flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Yes</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink/35\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg> No</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">volume-based</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">limited</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-ink/8 transition-colors hover:bg-cream-dark/30\"><td class=\"p-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink/85\">Starts at</td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm bg-gold-light/10\"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">Free / $29</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">$199</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">$79</span></td><td class=\"p-5 text-sm \"><span class=\"italic text-ink/70\">Free / $15</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-24 text-white md:py-32\" data-surface=\"dark\"><div class=\"grain-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-60\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute -top-32 right-0 h-[520px] w-[520px] opacity-30\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245,158,11,0.55) 0%, transparent 60%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:px-14\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><span class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-light\">The Yotpo Exodus</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.8rem)] leading-[0.98] tracking-tight text-balance\">Yotpo killed Email &amp; SMS on <em class=\"text-gold-light underline-hand\">Dec 31, 2025</em>.<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> We built the replacement.</h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-[1.55] text-pretty text-white/72\">EarnedStar Reviews + EarnedMail + EarnedSend + EarnedLoyalty — one platform, flat price, fully integrated. Replace Klaviyo, Attentive, and Yotpo with a single<!-- --> <span class=\"font-num text-gold-light\">$99</span>/month plan.</p><div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px bg-white/8 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"border border-white/10 bg-ink/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><div class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-2xl italic text-white\">EarnedMail</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-white/55\">Drag-drop campaigns, review-triggered flows, behavioral segments.</p></div><div class=\"border border-white/10 bg-ink/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square-text text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M7 11h10\"></path><path d=\"M7 15h6\"></path><path d=\"M7 7h8\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-2xl italic text-white\">EarnedSend</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-white/55\">Native SMS plus WhatsApp and Apple Business Messages.</p></div><div class=\"border border-white/10 bg-ink/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-coins text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.744 17.736a6 6 0 1 1-7.48-7.48\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h1v4\"></path><path d=\"m6.134 14.768.866-.5 2 3.464\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><div class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-2xl italic text-white\">EarnedLoyalty</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-white/55\">Points, referrals, VIP rewards — native to your review data.</p></div><div class=\"border border-white/10 bg-ink/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><div class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-2xl italic text-white\">AI Layer</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-white/55\">Smart-reply, summaries, sentiment, fraud — included.</p></div></div><a class=\"group mt-12 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffffff] px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-ink transition-shadow hover:shadow-2xl\" href=\"/yotpo-refugees\">Migrate from Yotpo · 3 months free<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"vellum-card gilded-edge relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-8 text-ink shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"gold-foil absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full opacity-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-dark\">Bill calculator</span></div><h3 class=\"relative mt-3 font-heading text-3xl italic\">Your current stack</h3><ul class=\"relative mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-ink/8 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-ink/65\">Klaviyo · Email · 10K subs</span><span class=\"font-num font-bold tabular-nums\">$150<span class=\"text-ink/40\">/mo</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-ink/8 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-ink/65\">Attentive · SMS · 10K sends</span><span class=\"font-num font-bold tabular-nums\">$300<span class=\"text-ink/40\">/mo</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-ink/8 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-ink/65\">Yotpo Reviews Pro</span><span class=\"font-num font-bold tabular-nums\">$199<span class=\"text-ink/40\">/mo</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-ink/8 pb-3\"><span class=\"text-ink/65\">Smile.io Loyalty</span><span class=\"font-num font-bold tabular-nums\">$49<span class=\"text-ink/40\">/mo</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between pt-2\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Total</span><span class=\"font-num text-2xl font-bold tabular-nums\">$698<span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-ink/40\">/mo</span></span></li></ul><div class=\"relative -mx-8 -mb-8 mt-7 rounded-b-2xl bg-ink p-7 text-white ring-light\"><div class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-light\">EarnedStar Growth</div><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"font-heading text-6xl tracking-tight\">$99</span><span class=\"text-sm text-white/55\">/mo · all-in</span></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-white/65\">You save <span class=\"gold-text font-num text-base font-bold\">$599/mo</span> ·<!-- --> <span class=\"font-num text-white/50\">$7,188/yr</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"hero-figma relative overflow-hidden py-24\" data-surface=\"dark\" data-scroll-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/4 top-1/3 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-gold/30 blur-[100px]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold/80\">Merchant stories</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl\">What store owners<!-- --> <span class=\"font-display italic text-gold\">actually say</span></h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-sm text-white/55\">Real verified reviews from merchants on Growth, Pro, and Agency plans.</p></div><div class=\"marquee-mask mt-14 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"marquee-track flex gap-6 py-2\"><article class=\"marketing-review-card w-[