/10 pt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-mid to-navy text-xs font-bold text-gold\">J</div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">James L.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-white/45\">Commerce Marketing Agency</p></div></div><p class=\"text-right text-xs font-semibold text-gold\">5<!-- -->.0 ★</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden py-24\" data-scroll-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-offset via-bg to-surface-offset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-px w-full max-w-4xl -translate-x-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/40 to-transparent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-light\">Pricing</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-navy sm:text-4xl\">Simple plans.<!-- --> <span class=\"font-display italic text-gold\">Earned</span> trust at every tier.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-text-muted\">Pricing shown for planning — paid billing is not active yet. Contact us for early access.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5 xl:items-stretch mt-16\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(15,32,68,0.08),0_16px_40px_rgba(15,32,68,0.06)] border-border\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy/20 via-border to-navy/20\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 pt-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold capitalize text-navy\">free</h3></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-navy\">$<!-- -->0<